# HDR-OUTPUT p1: Mac EDR output (scRGB linear) as UE r.HDR.*; Display.Output in machine.json (Scalability panel -> Display).
# The output is read from machine.json at boot (QualityBoot -> Window::SetDisplay); the panel's combo rebuilds the swapchain live.
Дано: BistroFoliageProj, B16_Bistro_Street_v70.desce, camera -20,170,330 look -126,-93,-154, daytime, Lit; machine.json Display.Output = SDR_sRGB.
Когда: shot-window after the scene settles.
Тогда 1_sdr кадр как до задачи (SDR-захват не изменился); editor.log "[Display] output SDR (sRGB): format BGRA8_UNORM colour space SRGB_NONLINEAR"
Дано: the same view; machine.json Display.Output = scRGB_Linear (or Scalability -> Display -> Display Output "scRGB linear (EDR)").
Когда: shot-window after the scene settles.
Тогда 2_edr editor.log "[Display] output scRGB linear (EDR): format RGBA16F colour space EXTENDED_SRGB_LINEAR", "[Display] OS: NSScreen ... EDR headroom > 1", paper white / peak in nits; "[Display] capture of the scRGB swapchain: peak > 1.000 x paper white" (the sun stone); the PNG (SDR rendition) matches 1_sdr outside the lifted highlights; UI at paper white
